<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνωμ-οσία</span></b>  (sts. wrongly written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνομ-</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>:
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόμνυμι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>being leagued by oath,
			conspiracy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				476
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.60
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. δήμου καταλύσεως</span>
			<i>for</i> putting down the democracy, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.401.36
			</span></i> (Chersonesus Taurica, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐν τῇ ξ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐκ τῆς ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπί τινα, ἡ κατά τινος
			ς</span>., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confederacy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς Ἀργείους
				γενομένη ξ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>body of men leagued by oath, political union</i> or
			<i>club</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.54
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				36b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				365d
			</span></i>.</div>
